   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Twinning med Lantm&#xe4;teriverket. Sidas st&#xf6;d inom detta beslut avser Lantm&#xe4;teriets kostnader f&#xf6;r framtagande av Twinning-kontraktet &quot;Support to the State Committee for Land and Cartography of the Republic of Azerbaijan in the field of establishment of the modern registration system of the state land in accordance to the EU evaluation standards&quot; AZIIENP-PCAJH19.EUs totala budget &#xe4;r 900000 EUR</narrative>
